{{suffix|en|retain|er}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ɹɪˈteɪn.ə/}}
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ɹɪˈteɪn.ɚ/|/ɹəˈteɪn.ɚ/}}
* {{rhymes|en|eɪnə(r)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any thing or person that [[retain]]s.
# A dependent or follower of someone of rank.
# A paid servant, especially one who has been employed for many years.
# A [[fee]] one pays to reserve the other's time for [[service]]s.
#: {{ux|en|This lawyer charges a '''retainer''' for his work.}}
# {{lb|en|dentistry}} A device that holds [[teeth]] in position after orthodontic treatment.
#* {{quote-song|en|title=Too Drunk to Fuck|artist=Dead Kennedys|year=1981|passage=You give me head / It makes it worse / Take out your fuckin' '''retainer''' / Put it in your purse}}
# {{lb|en|railroading|mechanical engineering}} A [[retaining valve]].

